Definition: Optical activity kuch maaddon ki woh salahiyat hai jis se woh guzarne wali light ka plane of polarization ghuma dete hain. Rotation polarizer aur analyzer se dekhi jati hai (Fig. 8.8). Aise maadde optically active kehlate hain.

Misalein: quartz crystals, cinnabar (HgS), cheeni ka paani, insulin aur collagen.

Awamil (factors): Rotation ki miqdaar aur simt in par munhasir hai:
(1) maadde ki qisam;
(2) maadde ka concentration (mixture ya solution ki di gayi miqdaar mein maadde ki miqdaar);
(3) maadde mein light ka tay kiya faasla;
(4) light ki wavelength.

Wajah: Optical activity molecules ki asymmetric (ghair-mutanasib), maslan helical, shakal ki wajah se hoti hai. Aise crystals ki chand millimetre motai plane of polarization ko kayi degrees ghuma deti hai.

Cheeni ka solution: Yeh plane of polarization ko θ angle ghuma deta hai, is liye analyzer crossed position se θ ghumane par hi light rokta hai.

Istemal: Cheeni aur tartaric acid jaise organic maadde solution mein optical rotation dikhate hain; is se solution mein un ka concentration maloom kiya jata hai.
